    <string name="ussd_help_title">USSD / Esimu enkop oleng\'ata</string>
    <string name="ussd_help_intro">Olaiteng\'en ojok oleng\'ata GBV/FGM meji smartphone kata internet. App eno ne aji oleng\'ata enkop esimu. Enjira USSD ne esimu oleng\'ata – meji sidai kama minto Kenya enkop toleo eno.</string>
    <string name="ussd_help_not_live_title">App eno meji USSD</string>
    <string name="ussd_help_not_live_body">Linda Binti enkop Android meji minto USSD. Meji Namba enkop hai enkop mradi. Safaricom kata line mwingine meji aji meji eng\'eni ne lango USSD ne aitum oleng\'ata oleng\'ata.</string>
    <string name="ussd_help_flow_title">Enkop ol oleng\'ata esimu enkop oleng\'ata</string>
    <string name="ussd_help_flow_body">Esimu enkop oleng\'ata → lango USSD → backend Linda Binti → ripoti GBV/FGM kata enkop ol enkigwanak → dashboard NGO. Namba 999, 112, 1195, na 116 ne aji enkop esimu eng\'eni.</string>
    <string name="ussd_help_offline_title">Ne aji sidai enkop smartphone meji internet</string>
    <string name="ussd_help_offline_body">Eisom, olaiteng\'en enkigwanak, Minto olaiteng\'en, Enkop ol olchani, aibuk ripoti, olaiteng\'en, olaiteng\'en oldeke, na Namba minto ne aibuk enkop esimu. Sync backend ne aji internet, enchoo, na akaunti USER.</string>
    <string name="ussd_help_sms_title">SOS SMS (meji ujumbe internet)</string>
    <string name="ussd_help_sms_body">SOS nejap ne aitum SMS olaiteng\'en enye. Ne aji enchoo SEND_SMS, SIM, na airitisho. Meji internet na meji ne aitum backend na backend. Enchoo enkop naa eng\'eni na meji melo aji SMS.</string>
    <string name="ussd_help_needs_title">Ne aji mifumo mingine</string>
    <string name="ussd_help_needs_body">Enchoo Android: SEND_SMS ne SOS; enkop eng\'eni ne ne aji kiungo ramani. Line esimu: aitum/aibuk SMS. Backend na internet: sync eng\'eni, enkop ol AI, dashboard. Olaiteng\'en USSD USSD: menyu eng\'eni. Meji Namba enkop ne aonyish ene.</string>
    <string name="ussd_help_cloud_available">Internet ne aji. Sync backend nejap naa enchoo na ne aji enchoo enye.</string>
    <string name="ussd_help_cloud_unavailable">Meji internet. Esekeri enkop esimu nejap ne aji. SOS SMS ne aji oleng\'ata ne line esimu na enchoo SMS.</string>
